<title>USA: NYSE CLOSING AVERAGES.</title>
<headline>NYSE CLOSING AVERAGES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower on Tuesday in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 101.27 to 7960.84.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 4.45 to 480.76.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.41.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1549 to 1252.</p>
<p>Volume was 498,892,470 compared with 480,337,200 on Monday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
